cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Framingham 10-Year CHD Risk — a leakage-free, imbalance-aware rebuild"
abstract: >-
  A rigorous rebuild of a coursework analysis of the Framingham Heart Study
  10-year CHD subset. Fixes a categorical-imputation defect and a
  preprocessing-before-split leak, replaces a single train/test split with
  stratified cross-validation, and reports calibration and decision-threshold
  analysis alongside accuracy.
authors:
